After being part of Alpha and Beta testing...
THIS REVIEW WILL GO STRAIGHT THROUGH EVERYTHING
GOODS :
- Fully free to play, will never be pay2win ;
- The spirit of Team Fortress 2 mixed with Worms and Smash Bros ;
- The best community i've ever known, old players giving thousands of weapons to new players and advices on global chat... Rare thing nowadays ;
- 6 balanced classes you can customize with hundreds of hats and accessories ;
- 9 different game modes (some will come back for events such as Zombie-Mode and Boss-Battles) ;
- Over 20 beautiful maps and a lot more to come, its huge !
- Over 120+ craftable weapons you can make at the Workshop with resources looted in game ;
- Each weapon offers a new play-style, think bout all the combos and synergies you can make !
- More content is going to be added to the game soon : new classes, weapons, maps, game-modes... Maybe ranked games and Team competitions ? :D
- A pleasure for casual players AND tryharders too ;
- New SEASON LADDER system that will soon be added and challenge people to do the most XP / kills every 2 or 3 months with good rewards at the end ;
- Had TOURNAMENTS during Beta, i wonder when will be the next one !
- Fan-art contests will reward the best creators (drawing, cosplays, sculptures, animations...) with unique items ;
- A shop full of cosmetics, you can also pay for pack openings (runes) and test your luck to get Legendary hats with nice effects ;
- A pet system like Pokemon where it gains XP when you kill other players and can evolve (from shop or looted during an event) ;
- Everything can be equiped at lvl 1, high level players are not stronger than new ones, only the skill matters ;
(If a weapon has a new stat or effect or a bonus it will also have malus somewhere else, that's how balance works here)
- References from series, other games and even punchlines are EVERYWHERE... On weapons and descriptions, hidden on maps... Take a closer look at the game you will see some Star Wars, Game of Thrones, Minecraft, Spongebob, Zelda, Pokemon, Stargate, Disneys and way more !
- Quest and Lottery system allowing you to unlock Shop Cosmetics like hats, skins and titles ;
- Grinding levels will allow you to unlock free weapons, a lot of hats, accessories, runes, lottery tickets and titles from lvl 1 to lvl 100 :)
- Guild system that can level up to get more slots for recruitment, the basic of a good community ;
- Trading system which is VERY IMPORTANT, trade your weapons and cosmetics with others to complete your collection ;
- Developers are actually playing the game and listening to everything we post on the forum so they can fix the bugs as soon as possible... Game is babysitted that's cool ;
- A lot of Moderators will maintain the good atmosphere anywhere you step ;
- Good servers for each concerned regions, be careful you will lag if you join the wrong server ;
- HIGH AMOUNT OF FUN I WOULD SAY
- Only 2 big Guilds are leading at the moment because its hard for new players to create one, you need to be Premium... Let's hope it will change asap !
- Guild HUD and options still need a lot of work to be perfect ;
- Shop/offers also need improvements, especially concerning runes and CK where you must wait weeks to get the CountKill weapon you want until the rune is put in the shop again ;
- You may experience some crashes on loading screens, it should be fixed shortly tho.
My overall notation will be 9/10, i expect it to become 10/10 when Guilds will become more "available"... I know i won't be disappointed ;)

