A game about collecting things that you will never use.
TL;DR - 9,5/10
Pros:
- Fun gameplay;
- Many classes;
- Customization;
- Good time collecting stuff;
- Unboxings with rare stuff. It became gaming addiction already.
Cons:
- Too long time to gain best possible items.
~~~~~~~~
Trove, game that at first sight looks like an abandoned "Cube World", is a fun game, settled in cubic world. The real objective is not set, but as for many sandbox game, it's either "Adventure, fight, build". Overall progress of game is measured in Mastery Points, which is upgrading as you add items to your collection for later use (for example mounts) by consuming them.The important aspect is customization. Even if you have your best equipment on you, you can always use other style of gear that you have collected before. Also, most mounts, wings and few other things share the same stats, making it possible to use them just for customization. Worst part of game are exceptions from the sentence before. Beeing horribly expensive, there are few items that are different, like dragons or recently added wonder birds. They give big advantage over other mounts and aren't replacable by other mount styles. Also, if one thinks that it is a game that you can become strong in easilly, that's not true. Best possible items are pain in the neck to get, and require hundreds of hours.

